node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 722
  s text Binaural Celesta Bell Harp Synth. Struck steel-plate celesta and crystal harp hybrid with FM mallet transient, wavefolded overtone body, and micro-detuned shimmer.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
cable out 0 pic
